    "tags": [],
    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<p><strong>Tier 3 — Shaman</strong></p><p><strong>“Corruption is still a conversation. It just stopped using words you like.”</strong></p><p>At Tier 3, you learn that wounded places do not need to be dominated to be changed. Corruption has rhythm, pressure, and predictable hungers. Terrain remembers what happened to it. Spirits remember what they lost. You can work with that.</p><p><strong>Tactical (Character Scale)</strong></p><ul><li>You reroll the lowest die on checks involving wilderness spirits, corrupted landscapes, natural omens, or reading environmental imbalance</li></ul><p><strong>Strategic (Faction Scale)</strong></p><ul><li>Once per Scenario involving corrupted terrain, distressed leyline flow, unnatural weather, or spirit unrest, choose one:</li><ul><li>gain <strong>Advantage</strong> on one relevant Strategic Roll, <em>or</em></li><li>negate one terrain- or corruption-based penalty affecting your faction for that Scene or operation</li></ul></ul><p><strong>Cost:</strong> working with wounded places means taking some of the wound into yourself. Expect emotional residue, spirit attachment, or moments where your own instincts start sounding suspiciously like the land’s pain.</p><div data-ft-per-use=\"1\" data-ft-per-use-key=\"shamT3\" style=\"margin-top:0.7rem;padding:0.55rem 0.75rem;border:1px solid #b08acc;border-radius:0.35rem;background:rgba(70,55,95,0.18);\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.78rem;letter-spacing:0.04em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#d4b8e8;margin-bottom:0.25rem\">⟁ Per-Use Ability — <strong>Spirit-Walk</strong></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.86rem;opacity:0.92;line-height:1.4\"><strong>Recovery:</strong> 1/Scenario &nbsp;·&nbsp; <strong>Action:</strong> Strategic &nbsp;·&nbsp; <strong>Use:</strong> Click this feature on your sheet to invoke.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.82rem;opacity:0.85;margin-top:0.3rem\">In a corrupted-terrain / leyline / weather / spirit unrest scenario: reroll-lowest on one Strategic Roll OR negate one terrain/corruption penalty.</div>\n</div>",
      "chat": ""
    },
